  "description": "Texas Instruments DRV2605L haptic driver for LRA and ERM actuators in the 10-pin VSSOP (DGS) package: 2-5.2 V supply, I2C target at fixed address 0x5A (400 kHz), licensed Immersion TouchSense 2200 effect library, closed-loop LRA auto-resonance (125-300 Hz), PWM/analog/trigger input on IN/TRIG, differential switching output, 4 uA shutdown.",
